<script setup lang="ts">import type{EmotionLabel,EmotionResult}from'../../core/models';defineProps<{result:EmotionResult;stale?:boolean}>();const emit=defineEmits<{select:[e:EmotionLabel];next:[];back:[]}>();const labels:EmotionLabel[]=['暴躁老哥','温柔姐姐','阴阳怪气','元气满满'];</script>
<template><section class="stage-card"><span class="kicker">03 / MOOD MATCH</span><h2>这段编排，有点像——</h2><div v-if="stale" class="error-banner" data-testid="stale-banner">编排在上次分析后被修改，分析结果已失效，请回编排台重新生成并分析。</div><div class="emotion-hero"><b>{{ result.label }}</b><strong>{{ Math.round(result.confidence*100) }}%</strong><p>{{ result.explanation }}</p></div><div class="emotion-options"><button v-for="label in labels" :key="label" type="button" :data-emotion="label" :class="{active:result.label===label}" @click="emit('select',label)">{{ label }}</button></div><div class="step-actions"><button type="button" class="ghost-button" data-testid="back-arrange-emotion" @click="emit('back')">← 回编排台调整</button><button data-testid="to-cover" class="acid-button" type="button" :disabled="stale" @click="emit('next')">用这个情绪做封面 →</button></div></section></template>
